cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this sysroot, cite the Debian packages it was assembled from.
title: riscv64-linux-gnu sysroot
abstract: >-
  Headers and libraries for the riscv64-linux-gnu target, assembled from
  sha256-pinned Debian cross packages so that clang on any host can build and
  link RISC-V Linux binaries. Redistributed unmodified apart from rewriting the
  absolute paths in libc.so's linker script to be sysroot-relative.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: The Debian Project
    website: https://www.debian.org/
url: https://deb.debian.org/debian/
repository: https://packages.debian.org/stable/
license:
  - LGPL-2.1-or-later
  - GPL-3.0-with-GCC-exception
